  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "The Good, The Rad, The Goofy. The CEO's toupée has been kidnapped! The ultimate ramp. The goofy foot adventure. Can you handle the chiptune madNES from the likes of these artists? Maybe... maybe not?! Newspaper headliners scream: &quot;Punk flattens CEO's toupée... Evil squad demolishes ramp... skateboarding suffers!? Now what 'chya gonna do when all the fuzz run wild on your crew? Scour sewers and alleys. Score hot decks and killer moves from Steve, Kjell, Nicky, Wayne, and Denny. Scrap together the ramp plans blowin' down the mean streets. Nail the nazis with stink eggs and slime. If you skate, you can relate!"
    }
  ],
